# The wheel ships the application, not the GitHub page.
#
# readme/ holds the images README.md links to — demo GIFs, screenshots, the
# mascot. None of them is read at runtime: the /readme mount is guarded by
# readme_dir.exists() and no served page requests it any more. Shipping them
# made the wheel 17.8 MB for roughly 1 MB of application.
#
# The wheel's file list otherwise comes from [tool.setuptools.package-data].
recursive-exclude ahafrog/readme *
